      "roundness": null,
      "text": "⚠ Verified fact: CI/CD deploys exactly 2 Docker images — NOT 19 microservices.\n• deploy-web.yml → capex-web only (context: capex-apps/)\n• deploy-api.yml → capex-api only (context: capexbe/ monolith)\n• verify-microservices.yml → PR gate only (static checks + leaf compile canary) — does NOT deploy leaf services\n• Full 19-service stack exists in deploy/docker-compose.microservices.yml — manual: make compose-up (not wired to GitHub Actions deploy)",
      "originalText": "⚠ Verified fact: CI/CD deploys exactly 2 Docker images — NOT 19 microservices.\n• deploy-web.yml → capex-web only (context: capex-apps/)\n• deploy-api.yml → capex-api only (context: capexbe/ monolith)\n• verify-microservices.yml → PR gate only (static checks + leaf compile canary) — does NOT deploy leaf services\n• Full 19-service stack exists in deploy/docker-compose.microservices.yml — manual: make compose-up (not wired to GitHub Actions deploy)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
